			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 760080101,
					"content": "Ah, may the moonlight shine upon your path ahead! Are you two here to pray to Lady Kuu{RUBY#[S]Moon Maiden}tar as well?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760080102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Eveliina"
				},
				{
					"id": 760080102,
					"content": "Prayer... you mean, in front of this statue? Huh, it really is huge...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760080103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 760080103,
					"content": "Hehe, beautiful, isn't it? This \"Idol of the New Moon\" was reportedly carved by a Moonchanter from five hundred years ago, depicting Lady Kuu{RUBY#[S]Moon Maiden}tar's original form.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760080104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Eveliina"
				},
				{
					"id": 760080104,
					"content": "As for Lady Kuu{RUBY#[S]Moon Maiden}tar's birth and the miracles she performed in this sublunary sphere... I am but a humble acolyte, so I shall refrain from going into too many details with you both.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760080105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Eveliina"
				},
				{
					"id": 760080105,
					"content": "In any case, this is the final destination of the pilgrimage route where wishes are offered to Lady Kuu{RUBY#[S]Moon Maiden}tar. Even if you didn't come here to pray, I hope you shall feel her blessings.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760080106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Eveliina"
				},
				{
					"id": 760080106,
					"content": "Oh, Paimon understands now... Eh? Wait, this is the end? Then what's that super imposing pillar up ahead?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760080107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 760080107,
					"content": "Ahaha... that's not actually a pillar. Beneath it is the \"Court of the First Edict\", an ancient sanctuary that was sealed off 500 years ago by Moonchanter decree.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760080108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Eveliina"
				},
				{
					"id": 760080108,
					"content": "In a sense... you could say it's forbidden ground for us Frostmoon Scions. And because of the Moonchanter's seal, no one can enter anymore, so it's better not to get too close.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760080109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Eveliina"
				},
				{
					"id": 760080109,
					"content": "And as for that huge edifice up there... it actually fell from the sky. By Lady Kuu{RUBY#[S]Moon Maiden}tar's grace, none of the falling debris hurt anyone...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760080110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Eveliina"
				},
				{
					"id": 760080110,
					"content": "Um, debris?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760080111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 760080111,
					"content": "Yes, when it came down, several fragments fell from it. One of them fell into the <color=#00E1FFFF>camp below</color>... You two must have seen it on your way here, right?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760080112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Eveliina"
				},
				{
					"id": 760080112,
					"content": "As for the other, slightly larger fragments, I remember that they mostly fell to the <color=#00E1FFFF>west</color>...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760080113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Eveliina"
				},
				{
					"id": 760080113,
					"content": "In any case, it was surely Lady Kuutar's guidance that brought you both here. Even if you did not come to pray, may the moonlight bless your path ahead.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Eveliina"
				}
			]
		}
	]
}